Z||000001||cobra427||03-07-2000||09:41 PM||||88, it is not a Fiero show in the true sense of the word.What it is , is a gathering of Fieroholics to try and reorganize a northeastern segment of the Fiero community. It seems that FOCONE is dieing and we up here in the N/E are going to try and rekindle and fire up a new member run club. So far, according to Ray Paulk, there are 25 commited people going(including myself and two others) and a lot of maybes.So if there is any possibility that you or anyone else is interested in wanting to be a part of that gathering,there is no fee and it commenses at 12:00PM Saterday . Just to see Bob Parkers operation is indeed worth the price of addmission. <BR>BTW,it is in Lebenon,Conn.<BR>C'mon down and check it out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
